cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ACR or its methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "ACR: The Arc Compute Rate"
abstract: >-
  A manipulation-resistant on-chain reference rate for machine compute on
  Circle's Arc. A state-space estimator recovers a constant-quality price from
  batched, adversarial x402 payment exhaust, publishes it hourly as EIP-712
  signed prints with an attack-cost-per-basis-point, and settles a cash-settled
  futures venue against it. The methodology is in docs/methodology.md.
type: software
authors:
